/- File: SessionMultiLib/Polytope.lean

  The session half of the polytope.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.Polytope's dependencies (convex.ml's `ConvexDeps`, the extra
  theorems from Session, SessionLibrary and SessionMultiLib, and the
  procedures), and exports every theorem by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/polytope.ml"`: its own `needs` (paths.ml) is the import
  of SessionMultiLib.Paths, and each bundle is built by `initialize` when the
  module is loaded, in file order.
-/

